==English==

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|id=preposition|:inh|enm:of<id:preposition>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|of}}, from {{inh|en|ang|of|t=from, out of, off}}, an unstressed form of {{m|ang|æf}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*ab}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*ab|t=away; away from}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₂epó|t=away}}. {{doublet|en|off}}, which is the stressed descendant of the same Old English word. More at {{l|en|off}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|en|ov|ob|o|o'|a}}

====Pronunciation====
; stressed
{{enPR|ŏv}}, {{rhymes|en|ɒv|s=1}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɒv/|aa=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɔv/|aa=SSB,Australia,New Zealand}}
{{enPR|ŭv}}, {{rhymes|en|ʌv}}
* {{IPA|en|/ʌv/|[ɐv~ʌv~əv]|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Naomi Persephone Amethyst (NaomiAmethyst)-of.wav|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-of.ogg|a=US}}
{{enPR|ŏf}}, {{rhymes|en|ɒf|s=1}}
* {{homophones|en|off}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɔf/|a=Indic}}
; unstressed
{{enPR|əv}}, {{IPA|en|/əv/|/ə/|a=Western|q2=before a consonant}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-piece of cake.ogg|a=US,unstressed|text=[[piece of cake]]}}
* {{homophones|en|'ve}} {{qualifier|unstressed '''of''' only, postconsonantal ''''ve''' only}}
* {{homophones|en|a}} {{qualifier|when {{IPAchar|/v/}} is [[w:elision|elided]]}}
{{enPR|əf}}, {{IPA|en|/əf/|/ə/|a=Indic|q2=before a consonant}}
* {{homophones|en|a}} {{qualifier|when {{IPAchar|/f/}} is [[w:elision|elided]]}}
